@startuml

actor User
participant MainViewController
participant AddApplicationController
participant ApplicationManager
participant JobApplication

User -> MainViewController : click Add Application
MainViewController -> AddApplicationController : load add form

User -> AddApplicationController : enter application details
User -> AddApplicationController : click Save

AddApplicationController -> AddApplicationController : validate input
AddApplicationController -> ApplicationManager : addApplication(...)
ApplicationManager -> JobApplication : create application
JobApplication --> ApplicationManager : new application
ApplicationManager --> AddApplicationController : application

AddApplicationController -> JobApplication : set follow-up date
AddApplicationController -> JobApplication : set notes

AddApplicationController --> MainViewController : return to main screen

@enduml